WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
- Take your time, we've got plenty of—

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.750
[Explosion]

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.541
- Nevermind, hurry up.

00:00:03.541 --> 00:00:06.375
- What's going on, Dad? I mean...Andy Reid.

00:00:06.375 --> 00:00:07.291
[Zombie attacking, growling]

00:00:07.291 --> 00:00:08.791
- No. Sweet baby Nick Foles.

00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:12.250
- I think a mutual change will benefit us both!

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:14.500
- I agree! I'm leaving on good terms!

00:00:15.291 --> 00:00:16.875
- Yo, they say the kid is special.

00:00:17.541 --> 00:00:19.875
- Oh, wow. The world sure is interesting.

00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:21.291
What does this do?

00:00:21.291 --> 00:00:22.625
- Show him, Pat.

00:00:22.625 --> 00:00:24.250
- A high ankle sprain?

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.750
But he's still moving.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:28.000
- I'm immune to bad things.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.875
- We need to take him to Arizona.

00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:31.041
- But it's been overrun...

00:00:31.041 --> 00:00:32.500
...by Philadelphians.

00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:36.041
- Go Birds.

00:00:36.041 --> 00:00:39.750
- Wow, another beautiful day in the zombie apocalypse.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:40.625
- [Together:] Oh, shocker.

00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:41.916
You're gonna make us the bad guys?

00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:44.000
Typical anti-Philly bias.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.500
- They're connected into one toxic hive mind.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.250
It's very scary.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.500
[Zombie growling]
[Clearing throat]

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.916
- Sorry, I'm hometown hero Haason Reddick.

00:00:52.541 --> 00:00:53.500
[Glass cracking]

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.041
- Scramble!
- Run! I'll block!

00:00:55.041 --> 00:00:55.916
- Do you still do that?

00:00:55.916 --> 00:00:56.666
- I'll try.

00:00:56.666 --> 00:00:59.000
- Aaaah! They sound so weird.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.916
- Woo! Jabroni thought he got me!

00:01:00.916 --> 00:01:03.666
- You've been infected...with Eaglemania.

00:01:03.666 --> 00:01:06.250
- No, no, I can stop this jawn! I mean...thing.

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:08.500
- He's changing.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.875
[Zombie transformation sounds]

00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:14.166
- Hey, Jabronis...go Birds.

00:01:14.166 --> 00:01:16.750
- It's Eagle Kelce! Run!

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:19.750
I think now might be a good time to give me some weapons.

00:01:20.791 --> 00:01:21.125
Here I am!

00:01:22.291 --> 00:01:22.875
Look, I slayed.

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:24.500
- Aaah!

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:26.458
- Illegal hurting of the main character.

00:01:26.458 --> 00:01:28.625
- I know it's not cool to say, but this kid is getting annoy—

00:01:29.291 --> 00:01:30.875
- This should be a fun level! I mean part.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.041
- Look, they've got runners...

00:01:33.041 --> 00:01:34.416
And All-Pro wideouts.

00:01:34.416 --> 00:01:36.416
- I thought those went extinct.

00:01:36.416 --> 00:01:37.500
[Thundering footsteps]

00:01:38.416 --> 00:01:40.166
- A Hurtser.

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:42.291
- Even though I'm a zombie, I'm still very hot.

00:01:42.291 --> 00:01:44.500
- Every now and then, you do need some defense.

00:01:44.958 --> 00:01:47.666
- Chris Joooooones.

00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:49.000
- Damn right, I'm on fire.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.166
- Aaaah.

00:01:50.166 --> 00:01:52.791
- [Announcer:] Wow, two young guys making the most of a tough situation.

00:01:52.791 --> 00:01:54.666
Speaking of finding love in a hopeless place,

00:01:54.666 --> 00:01:57.250
stick around for "Fedra Presents: The Rihanna Half-Fight Show."

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:00.125
- E, A, G, L...

00:02:00.125 --> 00:02:02.625
- M, N, O, P.

00:02:02.625 --> 00:02:03.416
- A battery?!

00:02:03.416 --> 00:02:04.416
- Time's up. Oh, wait...

00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:06.791
This watch is busted. Uh, time's yours.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:12.083
- Tyreek? Tyreek!

00:02:12.083 --> 00:02:15.125
If you find this, then I've gone to a better place.

00:02:15.125 --> 00:02:17.500
Or at least Miami...hehehe.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:18.875
I used to hate the world,

00:02:18.875 --> 00:02:19.791
But I was wrong.

00:02:19.791 --> 00:02:21.875
Because there was one person worth saving...

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:22.625
Me!

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:25.208
I wonder how I write him back!

